  <item>
    <title>西贝翻车，华与华却赢麻了？拆解舆论背后的品牌资产逻辑</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6900a827558113deb7dc56d6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6900a827558113deb7dc56d6</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 28 Oct 2025 11:29:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvMMmA8W4j6ZpVRsNDIvpC-5LNz8.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="295">04:55</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;西贝翻车真相：不是预制菜，是承诺和交付的断裂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="647">10:47</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;华与华“两大脑袋”背后的传播逻辑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="899">14:59</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;包装设计不是艺术，是为销售</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1298">21:38</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;精准流量转化不动时，泛流量破圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1984">33:04</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;“媒介即是信息”：你在哪投广告，比你投什么更重要</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2311">38:31</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;为什么“把不确定性留给自己”的人才能赚大钱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2457">40:57</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;创始人IP投流？看你敢不敢赌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3045">50:45</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;越骂越值钱？华与华舆情背后的品牌真相</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvMMmA8W4j6ZpVRsNDIvpC-5LNz8.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>关于我们}</span></p><span></span><p><span>Im操盘手是一档关注新媒体流量创业和运营模式的聊天式播客，搜罗各种在自媒体时代里，通过打破传统意义上变现路径的多种运营模式，让大家看到更多变现的可能，以及不同的操作手感和参与运营的建议</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家多多在评论区与我们互动，或者点击 听众留言 与我们联系，期待你的互动！</span></p><span></span><p><span>{制作}</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：钥钥，李解</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期制作：松松</span></p><span></span><p><span>图片：建豪</span></p>]]></description>
